{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1554043-the-world-alt-setting-modern-exess","id":1554043,"title":"The World [Alt Setting, Modern, ExEss]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-09-28T16:19:54-07:00","id":1554043,"title":"The World [Alt Setting, Modern, ExEss]","content":"So I had this idea for at least 10 years, one way or another.<br /> <br /> The World is, basically, an alternative setting for Exalted which uses concepts from both it and the Chronicles of Darkness to build an Urban Fantasy setting. The premise of the setting could be summed up as Omphalos Hypothesis meeting Evil God Hypothesis- the World is a fictional reality ruled by a evil force, who hates the protagonists in the most intimate way. The protagonists, in turn, are the Children- mortals imbued with the Essence of the makers of the World, known as the Principles. In this setting, the Children are faced with trying to carve their own place in the World, while fightings spiritual threats, each other, dark monstrosities, and the constant threat of Agnoia, where reality is edited just to spite them.<br /> <br /> While this setting reflects a lost of elements from both Exalted and the CofD, it is a strong deviation from both of them in many aspects. However, even if you are less interested in the setting, the game still offer de facto 10 new Exigents in the ExEss format, as well as some bonus mechanics that could be adapted (such as Mantles). While I didn't write Charms due to me just hating writing powers, the benefit of ExEss is the accessibility of Universal Charms- though if some people like this setting and want to help in those aspects and others, I'm all open for accepting writers.<br /> <br /> Anyway, this is the &quot;core setting&quot; document- the Book of the Principles. There are currently 10 planned supplements (hence why it is a project), whose pitches are detailed at the end of the doc. Feel free to comment and give feedback, and hope you'll like it!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bQP8aBE7JV9PjU6P_LH2ubVQn0jnkb0VLuzqZMTRlA4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Book of the Principles</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-30T06:40:50-07:00","id":1554056,"title":"","content":"Must admit that upon seeing the title, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DefXS17jZwE\" target=\"_blank\">something</a> else altogether crossed my mind - thought it might be sort of related, from a certain point of view?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-03T14:36:52-07:00","id":1554128,"title":"","content":